OL,3,GNEWSAIce rink and lights launch        
OL,4,AChristmas festival                     
OL,6,FThree days of festive activities       
OL,7,Fincluding live music, a pantomime and  
OL,8,Fan ice rink will get under way in      
OL,9,FBoston today.                          
OL,11,FThe town's Christmas Festival, which   
OL,12,Fwill run until Sunday, will open at    
OL,13,F14:00 GMT followed by entertainment and
OL,14,Fthe lights switch-on at 18:45.         
OL,16,FThere will be a festive market on      
OL,17,FSaturday and Sunday, as well as further
OL,18,Fentertainment.                         
OL,23,APub: 27-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
