OL,3,GNEWSAIce rink and lights launch        
OL,4,AChristmas festival                     
OL,6,FCouncillor Dale Broughton, the leader  
OL,7,Fof Boston Borough Council, said:       
OL,8,F"Previous festivals have been hugely   
OL,9,Fsuccessful, attracting thousands of    
OL,10,Fpeople into the town centre to enjoy   
OL,11,Fthe entertainment, support local       
OL,12,Fbusinesses and celebrate the festive   
OL,13,Fseason together, and we're confident   
OL,14,Fthis year's event will be no           
OL,15,Fdifferent."                            
